@startuml
title States: a session
[*] --> Nameless
Nameless --> Named : enter a name
Nameless --> Nameless : enter a name [blank] / a name is needed
Nameless --> Nameless : enter a room's name / enter a name first
Named --> InRoom : enter a room's name
Named --> Named : enter a room's name [blank] / a room's name is needed
InRoom --> InRoom : enter another room's name
InRoom --> InRoom : enter a room's name [blank] / a room's name is needed
InRoom --> InRoom : say something
InRoom --> Named : leave
Named --> [*] : log out
InRoom --> [*] : log out
@enduml
